Z||000016||Oreif||12-16-2001||05:27 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by stingant0:<BR><B>I had him off the line and when I went into 3rd he passed me. He runs 16.01 at the track. I know my car was running lean. His car was a 96 z24. </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Stock V-6 with Manual transmission Fiero's run in the low to mid 15's. I would say if you had him off the line and he passed you, You have a serious power problem with your car. It's time to figure out why it's not running right.<P>||||reg||1
